Nexaflow's JBIG2 decoder (src/Nexaflow.Media/Jbig2) is a port of Apache PDFBox's JBIG2 ImageIO plugin
(pdfbox-jbig2), by way of PdfPig.Filters.Jbig2.PdfboxJbig2 by BobLd, reworked for Nexaflow. Each source file names the
files it ports and says how it was changed. Its notice follows.

